   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "NFR-004  FAILS ON ARITHMETIC. 4 documents + 5 requirements already\n         cost 13 tracked files. 20 categories + 31 requirements is\n         ~65 files across 20 directories, against one register.\nTECH-008 half-pass \u2014 not a parallel STORE, but a parallel LAYOUT:\n         it cannot annotate docs/product/<slug>.md.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "NFR-004  FAILS ON ARITHMETIC. 4 documents + 5 requirements already\n         cost 13 tracked files. 20 categories + 31 requirements is\n         ~65 files across 20 directories, against one register.\nTECH-008 half-pass \u2014 not a parallel STORE, but a parallel LAYOUT:\n         it cannot annotate docs/product/<slug>.md.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
